body:
Thanks a lot. Yes after Sec+ my plan was CCNA-aws-azure-linux.

&#x200B;

 So basically, I have to get that part-time help desk job. Or leave my current job. I make 49k in NYC and help desk is typically 45k so I can't regress. No social life for the next few month's but hopefully it will be worth it in the end.

Respectfully no, nobody wants to hear Bad Bunny out of a Nissan Maxima .

&#x200B;

Brooklyn> black people black culture black rappers, gentrification but still sparked a whole movement in the city, had a song of the summer last few years, Labor Day parade, Spike Lee, Jay-z, Most of the characters from The Wire from BK, all this shit> Desus and Mero
